<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:cf="using:Cornflower.Controls"
                    xmlns:wp81="using:Cornflower.Themes.Wp81">
  <!--
    The Windows Phone 8.1 HyperlinkButton: the default style of the 8.1 Update 1 runtime (hyperlinkbutton.json,
    which equals the SDK's generic.xaml), re-expressed as an Avalonia ControlTheme. Every value the phone takes from
    a resource is its key, by DynamicResource; the padding and the weight are literals in the phone's style too.
    docs/controls/HyperlinkButton/PLAN.md has the values and their sources.

    It is plain text in the foreground, Segoe WP Semilight at 29.86 (Selawik Semilight here): no underline, no
    accent, no border. The template is the phone's Grid, Border and ContentPresenter:
    - Grid and Border stay untilted. Grid's transparent background takes the hits across the whole control, as Tilt
      needs of the root around its target, even when an app's Background is null; the phone's Grid has none, but its
      Border's transparent background does the same unless the app takes it away.
    - PART_ContentPresenter, the part Avalonia's Button looks for, is the phone's ContentPresenter, and the part the
      phone's PointerDownThemeAnimation targets: the tilt (Tilt.IsEnabled) is drawn on it alone (Tilt.IsTarget), not
      on the whole control as on a Button. As the root isn't tilted, a press at a tilted edge still clicks.

    The visual states: Pressed (Avalonia's :pressed) only tilts; the phone changes no colour. Disabled (:disabled)
    dims the text to HyperlinkDisabledThemeBrush. PointerOver changes nothing, so :pointerover has no style, and
    Avalonia's :visited has none either: the phone has no visited state. The phone has no focus states, so
    FocusAdorner is cleared.

    The TextBlock the presenter makes of content that isn't an element gets the phone's own line, 1.33 em, through
    PhoneContentLine (ADR 0003), as in the Button's theme.
  -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type HyperlinkButton}" TargetType="HyperlinkButton">
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource HyperlinkForegroundThemeBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource HyperlinkButtonBackgroundThemeBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource HyperlinkButtonBorderThemeBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="{DynamicResource HyperlinkButtonBorderThemeThickness}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,3,0,4" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource PhoneFontFamilySemiLight}" />
    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiLight" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource TextStyleExtraLargePlusFontSize}" />
    <!-- Not set by the phone's style: WinRT's own defaults for a Control, which Avalonia's are not. -->
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="FocusAdorner" Value="{x:Null}" />
    <Setter Property="cf:Tilt.IsEnabled" Value="True" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel x:Name="Grid" Background="Transparent">
          <Border x:Name="Border"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                  BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}">
            <ContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                              Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                              HorizontalAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                              VerticalAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}"
                              Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                              ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                              RecognizesAccessKey="True"
                              cf:Tilt.IsTarget="True"
                              wp81:PhoneContentLine.IsEnabled="True" />
          </Border>
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource HyperlinkDisabledThemeBrush}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>
</ResourceDictionary>
